<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- /wp:mediaron/alerts-dlx-alert -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Try it out for yourself when you get a chance by <a href="/edit">editing this post</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Be sure to <a href="/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=singular-alerts">visit the admin options</a> to adjust global styles and presets, and even build a shortcode with the built-in shortcode builder.</p>
